          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the beginning, when God created the universe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "In the beginning",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the universe",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "In the beginning God created the universe",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "When God began to create the universe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the earth was formless and desolate. The raging ocean that covered everything was engulfed in total darkness, and the Spirit of God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the Spirit of God",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the power of God",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "a wind from God",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "an awesome wind.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " was moving over the water. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.4.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cor 4.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then God commanded, “Let there be light” — and light appeared. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God was pleased with what he saw. Then he separated the light from the darkness, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he named the light “Day” and the darkness “Night”. Evening passed and morning came — that was the first day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.6+GEN.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.6",
              "GEN.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Pet 3.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then God commanded, “Let there be a dome to divide the water and to keep it in two separate places” — and it was done. So God made a dome, and it separated the water under it from the water above it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.6+GEN.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.6",
              "GEN.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He named the dome “Sky”. Evening passed and morning came — that was the second day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then God commanded, “Let the water below the sky come together in one place, so that the land will appear” — and it was done. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He named the land “Earth”, and the water which had come together he named “Sea”. And God was pleased with what he saw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he commanded, “Let the earth produce all kinds of plants, those that bear grain and those that bear fruit” — and it was done. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the earth produced all kinds of plants, and God was pleased with what he saw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Evening passed and morning came — that was the third day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then God commanded, “Let lights appear in the sky to separate day from night and to show the time when days, years, and religious festivals",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "religious festivals",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "seasons.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " begin; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they will shine in the sky to give light to the earth” — and it was done. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So God made the two larger lights, the sun to rule over the day and the moon to rule over the night; he also made the stars. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He placed the lights in the sky to shine on the earth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to rule over the day and the night, and to separate light from darkness. And God was pleased with what he saw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Evening passed and morning came — that was the fourth day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then God commanded, “Let the water be filled with many kinds of living beings, and let the air be filled with birds.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So God created the great sea monsters, all kinds of creatures that live in the water, and all kinds of birds. And God was pleased with what he saw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He blessed them all and told the creatures that live in the water to reproduce, and to fill the sea, and he told the birds to increase in number. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Evening passed and morning came — that was the fifth day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
