          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then God commanded, “Let the earth produce all kinds of animal life: domestic and wild, large and small” — and it was done. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So God made them all, and he was pleased with what he saw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
