              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "blessed them, and said, “Have many children, so that your descendants will live all over the earth and bring it under their control. I am putting you in charge of the fish, the birds, and all the wild animals. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
